<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīmen</span></b> , ĭnis,
			n.
		vieo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pliant twig</i>, <i>a switch</i>, <i>withe</i>, <i>osier</i>, etc.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 23, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Caes. B. G. 2, 33</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7,
			73</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. B. C. 1, 54</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 2</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				E. 2, 72</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. A. 6, 137</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 2, 3,
				15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 6, 345
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A set</i>, <i>slip;</i> of willow,
				<i><span class="en">Col.
				4, 30, 3</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The staff</i> or <i>wand of
			Mercury</i>, <i><span class="en">Stat. Th. 2,
			30</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Woven work</i>, esp. <i>a basket</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quernum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 12, 436</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">breve Picenorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					4, 88, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
